恐縮ですが、ぜひご検討いただけますようお願い申し上げます。何卒よろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Ectoria/works/40", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1d018872/uploads/origins/3fe81998-513e-4200-a5a4-16c344395404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92c479e09add2579287285405703af9e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1d018872/uploads/origins/3fe81998-513e-4200-a5a4-16c344395404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92c479e09add2579287285405703af9e, https://si.imgix.net/1d018872/uploads/origins/3fe81998-513e-4200-a5a4-16c344395404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e81fccd0ddd43c74f59a894aa68cad06 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1d018872/uploads/origins/3fe81998-513e-4200-a5a4-16c344395404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4072cfc8460c0715919a03ec1796ac83 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "私の持ちキャラ、月島もんじゃをお任せします。よろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Ectoria/works/39", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bb40c065/uploads/origins/43ce2863-4be4-4485-a0f2-db5c8f1b57ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34f1dfdeec01bb7b8412b23c2ab9026b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bb40c065/uploads/origins/43ce2863-4be4-4485-a0f2-db5c8f1b57ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34f1dfdeec01bb7b8412b23c2ab9026b, https://si.imgix.net/bb40c065/uploads/origins/43ce2863-4be4-4485-a0f2-db5c8f1b57ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fce14c9c7f39fb47eaeeed27141773f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bb40c065/uploads/origins/43ce2863-4be4-4485-a0f2-db5c8f1b57ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03eb5af0af12c569ae1bb0b66581e4a6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、不死身系Vtuberの桧堂リアです！\n\nミニキャラで私のイラストを制作いただきたく、リクエストをお送り